efibootnext (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace initramfs approach with GRUB bootnext module.
  * Detect EFI boot entries directly from efibootmgr instead of os-prober.
  * Remove initramfs-tools hooks and premount scripts.
  * Drop os-prober and initramfs-tools dependencies.
  * Add GRUB_BOOTNEXT_DISABLE, GRUB_BOOTNEXT_INCLUDE, and
    GRUB_BOOTNEXT_EXCLUDE configuration options.
  * Clean up old initramfs paths on upgrade.

 -- Thomas Grainger <tagrain@gmail.com>  Fri, 20 Mar 2026 14:00:00 +0000

