efibootnext (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial .deb packaging.
  * Move files into etc/ directory structure.
  * Add postinst/postrm to run update-grub and update-initramfs.
  * Fix license mismatch (now MIT throughout).
  * Add grub-common as explicit dependency.
  * Auto-detect Windows via os-prober and match EFI boot entry.
  * Run before LUKS prompt to avoid unnecessary password entry.
  * Validate bootnext parameter and handle efibootmgr failures gracefully.
  * Respect GRUB_DISABLE_OS_PROBER and GRUB_OS_PROBER_SKIP_LIST.

 -- Thomas Grainger <tagrain@gmail.com>  Thu, 19 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0000
